# Impeccable's per-session design-hook cache. Machine-local and keyed by
# session id, so it must never be committed. It was only ever excluded via
# .git/info/exclude, which is not shared — every other clone saw it as
# untracked noise. The design.json sidecar beside it IS tracked.
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
